From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:53:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2860/3799] soh: rename D_80ADD79C -> sPostYaws

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the yaw each sister faces once she reaches her post
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
index dde4597d6..812d12ed0 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
@@ -177,7 +177,8 @@ static InitChainEntry sInitChain[] = {
 
 static Vec3f sZeroVector = { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };
 
-static s16 D_80ADD79C[4] = { 0xB000, 0xD000, 0x5000, 0x3000 };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80ADD79C: the yaw each sister faces once she reaches her post
+static s16 sPostYaws[4] = { 0xB000, 0xD000, 0x5000, 0x3000 };  // was D_80ADD79C [LLM:HIGH]
 
 static Vec3s D_80ADD7A4[4] = {
     { -22, 337, -1704 },
@@ -621,7 +622,7 @@ void EnPoSisters_SetupTurnToPost(EnPoSisters* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->unk_199 = 40;
     this->unk_19A = 90;
     this->unk_196 = 32;
-    this->actor.world.rot.y = D_80ADD79C[this->unk_194];
+    this->actor.world.rot.y = sPostYaws[this->unk_194];  // was D_80ADD79C [LLM:HIGH]
     this->actor.home.pos.y = this->actor.world.pos.y;
     if (this->unk_194 == 0) {
         Flags_SetSwitch(play, 0x1B);
